<td id="S4.T3.8.3.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.14</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T3.8.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T3.8.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">Narrative structure &amp; flow</th>
<td id="S4.T3.8.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">4.96 (1.08)</td>
