</section>
<section id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Results.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ Results. ‣ A.4. Expert Evaluation of Narrative Structure Optimization ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Auto-Slides: An Interactive Multi-Agent System for Creating and Customizing Research Presentations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> presents the detailed results corresponding to the summary in Table <a href="#S4.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 4.4. User Study 3: Evaluating Narrative Structure Optimization from Experts’ Perspective ‣ 4. Experiments ‣ Auto-Slides: An Interactive Multi-Agent System for Creating and Customizing Research Presentations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> of the main text.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T11" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11. </span>Expert evaluation results for <span id="A1.T11.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Auto-Slides</span> with and without narrative structure optimization (<math id="A1.T11.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=8</annotation></semantics></math>). Ratings are mean scores across three items per dimension (7-point Likert scale). <math id="A1.T11.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{z}</annotation></semantics></math> = Cohen’s <math id="A1.T11.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math> for paired samples.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T11.10" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
