<section id="A1.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.5. </span>LLM-as-Judge Evaluation Materials</h3>

<div id="A1.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section presents the complete materials and results for the automated LLM-as-Judge ablation evaluation described in §<a href="#S4.SS5" title="4.5. Automatic Evaluation: LLM-as-Judge Component Ablation ‣ 4. Experiments ‣ Auto-Slides: An Interactive Multi-Agent System for Creating and Customizing Research Presentations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Evaluation Setup.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We used GPT-4o<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib23" title="" class="ltx_ref">OpenAI, 2024</a>)</cite> and Claude-3.7-Sonnet<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib3" title="" class="ltx_ref">Anthropic, 2024</a>)</cite> models as judges, with deterministic output (temperature = 0.0). Evaluations were run bidirectionally to control for position bias.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Criteria and Prompts.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We defined criteria for <em id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Table &amp; Formula Fidelity</em> and <em id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Content Accuracy</em>, and supplied detailed prompt templates (Appendix <a href="#A1.SS5.SSS0.Px4" title="Generic System Prompt Template ‣ A.5. LLM-as-Judge Evaluation Materials ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Auto-Slides: An Interactive Multi-Agent System for Creating and Customizing Research Presentations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.5</span></a>) to the judge models.
The evaluation criteria are listed in Table <a href="#S4.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ 4.5. Automatic Evaluation: LLM-as-Judge Component Ablation ‣ 4. Experiments ‣ Auto-Slides: An Interactive Multi-Agent System for Creating and Customizing Research Presentations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> of the main text.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Prompt Templates.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">System and user prompt formats are reproduced below for transparency, enabling exact replication of the comparative evaluation.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Generic System Prompt Template</h4>

<div id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<div id="A1.SS5.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_text ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">You</span><span id="lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">are</span><span id="lstnumberx1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">an</span><span id="lstnumberx1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">expert</span><span id="lstnumberx1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">academic</span><span id="lstnumberx1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">presentation</span><span id="lstnumberx1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">evaluator</span>.<span id="lstnumberx1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">You</span><span id="lstnumberx1.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">will</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">compare</span><span id="lstnumberx2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">two</span><span id="lstnumberx2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">presentations</span><span id="lstnumberx2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">in</span><span id="lstnumberx2.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">terms</span><span id="lstnumberx2.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">of</span><span id="lstnumberx2.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>"{<span id="lstnumberx2.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">CRITERIA_NAME</span>}".
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">Focus</span><span id="lstnumberx3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">on</span>:
</div>
