<figure id="A1.T15" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 15. </span>Detailed forward/reverse <span id="A1.T15.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLM-as-judge</span> results for <em id="A1.T15.15" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Table &amp; Formula Fidelity</em> using Claude<span id="A1.T15.16" class="ltx_text">-</span>3.7<span id="A1.T15.17" class="ltx_text">-</span>Sonnet.
“Forward” = Original <math id="A1.T15.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Ablation; “Reverse” = Ablation <math id="A1.T15.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Original; final results are collapsed to Win/Tie/Loss.</figcaption>
