<section id="A1.SS8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.8. </span>Example Slides Generated by <span id="A1.SS8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Auto-Slides</span></h3>

<div id="A1.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A1.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ A.8. Example Slides Generated by Auto-Slides ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Auto-Slides: An Interactive Multi-Agent System for Creating and Customizing Research Presentations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> shows several example slides generated by <span id="A1.SS8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Auto-Slides</span>. These materials were automatically produced from input research papers<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib46" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhuang et al., 2025</a>; <a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lei et al., 2025</a>; <a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">Mildenhall et al., 2020</a>; <a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">Liu et al., 2024</a>)</cite> via our LLM-based pipeline. The examples demonstrate visual layout and inclusion of key elements such as diagrams.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.11062v1/section/img/examples.png" id="A1.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/239;" width="476" height="239" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5. </span>Example slides generated by <span id="A1.F5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Auto-Slides</span>, showing how the system transforms a research paper into a structured and learner-friendly slide deck.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
</article>
